{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10125080","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10125080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1012508001:0":{"text":"다들 편지 봤지... 이곳은 이미르의 은신처가 확실해. 여기서 치료를 하려면 호위가 필요했기 때문에 블랙골드 상회의 사람들이 이곳에 머무른 거고.","source_cn":"信件大家都看过了吧……这里的确是伊米尔的藏身处，他在这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F07863F473A4594","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012508002:1":{"text":"중요한 정보도 잊지 마. 이미르가 약속한 보수는 바로 이 땅이야. 이미... 이곳은 블랙골드 상회의 실험 밭이 되었겠어.","source_cn":"别落下关键信息，伊米尔承诺的酬劳是这片土地，恐怕……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x025401858FDD42C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012508003:1":{"text":"그에겐 그럴 권리가 없어!","source_cn":"他无权这么做！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC14607EBBB651FAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012508004:1":{"text":"땅을 팔아 블랙골드 상회에게 넘겨주다니, 만인이 우러러보는 이미르 대현자는 얼마나 더 거짓말을 할 셈이지?","source_cn":"出卖土地给黑金商会，万人敬仰的伊米尔大贤者到底还有多少谎言？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E357B4F11E731E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012508005:0":{"text":"호위의 대가로 그런 보수를 주다니, 꽤 크게 다쳤나 보군.","source_cn":"如此酬劳换来的守卫，看样子他伤得不轻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C20B28DEC3B79C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012508006:1":{"text":"너희들 뭐야? 절대 도망 못 가!","source_cn":"嘎哈！被我抓到了！这下你们跑不了了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD1702F156807D8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012508007:1":{"text":"토끼 귀 참 귀엽네. 아쉽지만 너흰 곧 내 안주거리가 될 거야!","source_cn":"你们的耳朵真可爱啊，只可惜，你们很快就要成为我的下酒菜了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58F6BB54AFBAE92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012508008:1":{"text":"이미르는 멀리 못 갔을 거야. 어서 쫓아가자.","source_cn":"伊米尔应该跑不远，我们尽快追击。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90EDA4392335AA3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012508009:1":{"text":"그리고... 왜 아무도 이미르의 글씨체에 토를 안 달지? 레오프론의 편지지에 이렇게 못난 글씨를 쓰다니.","source_cn":"还有……就没人吐槽下伊米尔的字迹吗？没想到写在耀光信纸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8298B25310634693","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1012508010:1":{"text":"알아볼 수 있다면 연습은 좀 했다는 거겠죠.","source_cn":"能看懂说明还是练过的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0491A73F98D3F145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012508011:1":{"text":"<shk>나쁜 자식!</shk> 감히 나를 무시해?!","source_cn":"<shk>混蛋！</shk>你们竟然敢无视老子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E0441AEA9D85AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012508012:1":{"text":"너무 시끄러워 조용히 시켜야겠어요.","source_cn":"好吵，让他安静下来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x891A6531A948B5F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑金商会打手":{"text":"블랙골드 상회 경호원","source":"黑金商会打手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":5}}